Given:

cot A = 15/8

Concept used:

1. tan 2α = frac {2 times tan α}{(1 - tan² α)}

2. tan α = 1/cot α 

Calculation:

cot A = 15/8

⇒ tan A = 8/15

Now, tan 2 A

⇒ frac {2 times tan A}{(1 - tan² A)}

⇒ frac {2 times frac {8}{15}}{(1 - (frac {8}{15})²)}

⇒ frac {frac {16}{15}}{frac {161}{225}}

⇒ {frac {16 times 225}{15 times 161}}

⇒ 240/161

**∴ The value of tan 2A is 240/161.**

Given:

p = 7 + 4 sqrt{3}

Concept used:

1. a² - b² = (a + b)(a - b)

2. a³ + b³ = (a + b)³ - 3ab(a + b)

Calculation:

p = 7 + 4 sqrt{3}

⇒ 1/p = 1/(7 + 4 sqrt{3})

⇒ frac {1}{p} = frac {(7 - 4sqrt3)}{(7 - 4sqrt3)(7 + 4sqrt3)}

⇒ frac {1}{p} = frac {(7 - 4sqrt3)}{49 - 48}

⇒ frac {1}{p} = frac {(7 - 4sqrt3)}{1}

⇒ frac {1}{p} = {(7 - 4sqrt3)}

So, p + 1/p

⇒ 7 + 4 sqrt{3} + 7 - 4 sqrt{3}

⇒ 14

Now, (p⁶ + p⁴ + p² + 1 )/(p³)

⇒ (p³ + frac {1}{p³}) + (p + frac {1}{p})

⇒ (p + frac {1}{p})³ - 3(p + frac {1}{p}) + (p + frac {1}{p})

⇒ 14³ - 2 × 14

⇒ 2716

∴ The value of (p⁶ + p⁴ + p² + 1 )/(p³) is 2716.
